          "segmentId": "m00020:alt:fig-00005-alt",
          "text": "Text image says formal charge equals number of free atom valence electrons minus number of bonded atom valence electrons (latter is half of bonding plus all nonbonding electrons)."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_02_03_005.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
